## 4. MATERIALS BOM (target retail-cost tier)

| Part | Material | Est. unit cost @ scale |
|---|---|---|
| Outer shell | Clear PC | $0.80 |
| Bumper frame | TPU | $0.60 |
| Gear train (4–6 gears) | Brass/POM | $1.20 |
| Spin dial + bearing | Stainless/ceramic bearing, brass rim weights | $1.50 |
| Rotor (ambient) | Tungsten or brass | $0.90 |
| Generator coil+magnet | Copper coil, NdFeB magnet | $1.10 |
| Piezo ring | PZT discs (4–6) | $0.70 |
| PCB (rectifier+regulator+LED) | Standard SMD | $1.40 |
| Supercapacitor | 1–3F | $0.90 |
| USB-C port assembly | Standard | $0.60 |
| Misc (screws, gaskets, adhesive, packaging) | — | $0.80 |
| **Total est. BOM** | | **~$10.50/unit** |

Target retail: **$39–49**, same shelf tier as premium rugged cases (Otterbox Defender-class), justified by the mechanical novelty + genuine utility.

---

## 5. ASSEMBLY OVERVIEW

1. Internal frame molded/assembled first — gear train, rotor, generator, piezo ring mounted and aligned on shock-isolated subframe.
2. PCB (rectifier/regulator/LED/port) wired to generator + piezo leads, secured to subframe.
3. Subframe seated into TPU bumper shell, gasket-sealed at gear compartment.
4. Clear PC outer shell snap-fit or ultrasonic-welded over assembly, leaving gear window unobstructed.
5. Spin dial bearing pressed into case-back cutout, ratchet engaged to gear train input shaft.
6. Final seal, drop-test QC, output-voltage QC per unit.

---

## 6. OPEN SOURCE TERMS

This design is released into the open. No patent claims, no licensing fees, no gatekeeping.
- Build it. Modify it. Manufacture it. Sell it under your own brand.
- Attribution appreciated, not required.
- If you improve the mechanism, the ethos asks (doesn't require) that you keep the improvement open too — but that's a request to the community, not an enforceable term.

**Core inversion principle behind this release:** kinetic energy harvesting hardware already exists (watch rotors, hand-crank generators, piezo sensors) — the only missing variable was someone fusing the pieces into a desirable consumer object instead of a lab demo. Energy abundance starts with refusing to gatekeep the recombination.

